### concat_list

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl concat_list separator input =\n    (input, { acc = \"\"; sep = \"\" })\n    ||> listm.foldBack fun (x : string) { acc sep } => {\n        acc = x ++# sep ++# acc\n        sep = separator\n    }\n    |> fun { acc } => acc","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl concat_list separator input =
      (input, { acc = ""; sep = "" })
      ||> listm.foldBack fun (x : string) { acc sep } => {
          acc = x ++# sep ++# acc
          sep = separator
      }
      |> fun { acc } => acc
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

