### concat_array

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl concat_array (separator : string) (input : a int string) =\n    (input, { acc = \"\"; sep = \"\" })\n    ||> am.foldBack fun (x : string) { acc sep } =>\n            { acc = x ++# sep ++# acc; sep = separator }\n    |> fun { acc } => acc","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl concat_array (separator : string) (input : a int string) =
      (input, { acc = ""; sep = "" })
      ||> am.foldBack fun (x : string) { acc sep } =>
              { acc = x ++# sep ++# acc; sep = separator }
      |> fun { acc } => acc
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --print-code\n///> fsharp\n///> rust\n///> typescript\n///> cuda\n\n;[\n    \"1\"\n    \"2\"\n    \"3\"\n]\n|> fun x =>\n    inl code = (a x : _ int _) |> concat_array \"\\n\"\n    code\n    |> _assert_eq \"1\\n2\\n3\"","print_code":true},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --print-code
  ///> fsharp
  ///> rust
  ///> typescript
  ///> cuda

  ;[
      "1"
      "2"
      "3"
  ]
  |> fun x =>
      inl code = (a x : _ int _) |> concat_array "\n"
