### last_index_of

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl last_index_of (search : string) (s : string) : i32 =\n    inl search = dyn search\n    run_target function\n        | Rust => fun () => $'!s.rfind(&*!search).map(|i| i as i32).unwrap_or(-1)' : i32\n        | _ => fun () => $'!s.LastIndexOf !search ' : i32","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl last_index_of (search : string) (s : string) : i32 =
      inl search = dyn search
      run_target function
          | Rust => fun () => $'!s.rfind(&*!search).map(|i| i as i32).unwrap_or(-1)' : i32
          | _ => fun () => $'!s.LastIndexOf !search ' : i32
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

