### convert_to_utf32

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl convert_to_utf32 (c : char) : int =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = fun () => c |> convert.i32\n        Lua = fun () => c |> convert.i32\n        Fsharp = fun () =>\n            run_target_args' c function\n            | Fsharp => fun c => $'System.Char.ConvertToUtf32 (string !c, 0)' : int\n            | _ => fun c => c |> convert.i32\n        Python = fun () => $'ord(!c)' : int\n        Rust = fun () => $'(!c as `int)' : int\n        TypeScript = fun () => $'(!c)' : int\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl convert_to_utf32 (c : char) : int =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = fun () => c |> convert.i32
          Lua = fun () => c |> convert.i32
          Fsharp = fun () =>
              run_target_args' c function
              | Fsharp => fun c => $'System.Char.ConvertToUtf32 (string !c, 0)' : int
              | _ => fun c => c |> convert.i32
          Python = fun () => $'ord(!c)' : int
          Rust = fun () => $'(!c as `int)' : int
          TypeScript = fun () => $'(!c)' : int
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

