### builder_append

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl builder_append (item : string) (sb : string_builder) : string_builder =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = fun () =>\n            $'!sb <> !item ' : string_builder\n        Lua = fun () =>\n            $'!sb .. !item ' : string_builder\n        Fsharp = fun () =>\n            ($'!sb.Append' item : string_builder) |> ignore\n            sb\n        Python = fun () =>\n            ($'!sb.write(!item)' : int) |> ignore\n            sb\n        Rust = fun () => $'{ let mut r = !sb.clone(); r.push_str(&*!item); r }' : string_builder\n        TypeScript = fun () => $'!sb + !item ' : string_builder\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl builder_append (item : string) (sb : string_builder) : string_builder =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = fun () =>
              $'!sb <> !item ' : string_builder
          Lua = fun () =>
              $'!sb .. !item ' : string_builder
          Fsharp = fun () =>
              ($'!sb.Append' item : string_builder) |> ignore
              sb
          Python = fun () =>
              ($'!sb.write(!item)' : int) |> ignore
              sb
          Rust = fun () => $'{ let mut r = !sb.clone(); r.push_str(&*!item); r }' : string_builder
          TypeScript = fun () => $'!sb + !item ' : string_builder
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
