### builder_append_line

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl builder_append_line (sb : string_builder) : string_builder =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = fun () =>\n            sb |> builder_append \"\\n\"\n        Lua = fun () =>\n            sb |> builder_append \"\\n\"\n        Fsharp = fun () =>\n            ($'!sb.AppendLine ()' : string_builder) |> ignore\n            sb\n        Python = fun () =>\n            sb |> builder_append \"\\n\"\n        Rust = fun () =>\n            sb |> builder_append \"\\n\"\n        TypeScript = fun () =>\n            sb |> builder_append \"\\n\"\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl builder_append_line (sb : string_builder) : string_builder =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = fun () =>
              sb |> builder_append "\n"
          Lua = fun () =>
              sb |> builder_append "\n"
          Fsharp = fun () =>
              ($'!sb.AppendLine ()' : string_builder) |> ignore
              sb
          Python = fun () =>
              sb |> builder_append "\n"
          Rust = fun () =>
              sb |> builder_append "\n"
          TypeScript = fun () =>
              sb |> builder_append "\n"
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

