### span_from

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl span_from pred str i0 =\n    inl len = str |> length\n    inl rec body (i : int) =\n        if i >= len\n        then i\n        elif str |> index i |> pred\n        then 루프 (i + 1)\n        else i\n    and inl 루프 i = join_body_unit body (if var_is i then i else len) i\n    i0 |> 루프","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl span_from pred str i0 =
      inl len = str |> length
      inl rec body (i : int) =
          if i >= len
          then i
          elif str |> index i |> pred
          then 루프 (i + 1)
          else i
      and inl 루프 i = join_body_unit body (if var_is i then i else len) i
      i0 |> 루프
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

