### trim_start

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl trim_start (chars : list char) (input : string) : string =\n    inl chars = if chars = [] then trim_chars () else chars\n    inl len = input |> length\n    let rec 루프 (i : int) =\n        if i >= len\n        then len\n        elif input |> index i |> char_contains chars\n        then 루프 (i + 1)\n        else i\n    input |> slice (루프 0) (len - 1)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl trim_start (chars : list char) (input : string) : string =
      inl chars = if chars = [] then trim_chars () else chars
      inl len = input |> length
      let rec 루프 (i : int) =
          if i >= len
          then len
          elif input |> index i |> char_contains chars
          then 루프 (i + 1)
          else i
      input |> slice (루프 0) (len - 1)
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n///> gleam\n///> fsharp\n///> cuda\n\n\"  abc  \"\n|> trim_start []\n|> _assert_eq \"abc  \"\n\n\"abcde\"\n|> trim_start []\n|> _assert_eq \"abcde\"\n\n\"abcde\"\n|> trim_start [ 'a' ]\n|> _assert_eq \"bcde\"\n\n\"abcde\"\n|> trim_start [ 'b'; 'a' ]\n|> _assert_eq \"cde\"\n\n\"abcde\"\n|> trim_start [ 'c'; 'b'; 'a' ]\n|> _assert_eq \"de\"","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

