### concat

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl concat (a : string) (b : seq.seq' string) : string =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = fun () =>\n            global \"import gleam/string\"\n            $'!b |> string.join(!a)' : string\n        Lua = fun () => $'table.concat(!b, !a)' : string\n        Fsharp = fun () =>\n            inl a =\n                if a = \"\\n\"\n                then join a\n                else a\n            b |> $'String.concat' a : string\n        Python = fun () =>\n            $'!a.join(!b)' : string\n        Rust = fun () => $'Rc::<str>::from(!b.iter().map(|x| x.to_string()).collect::<Vec<_>>().join(&*!a))' : string\n        TypeScript = fun () => $'!b.join(!a)' : string\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl concat (a : string) (b : seq.seq' string) : string =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = fun () =>
              global "import gleam/string"
              $'!b |> string.join(!a)' : string
          Lua = fun () => $'table.concat(!b, !a)' : string
          Fsharp = fun () =>
              inl a =
                  if a = "\n"
                  then join a
                  else a
              b |> $'String.concat' a : string
          Python = fun () =>
              $'!a.join(!b)' : string
          Rust = fun () => $'Rc::<str>::from(!b.iter().map(|x| x.to_string()).collect::<Vec<_>>().join(&*!a))' : string
          TypeScript = fun () => $'!b.join(!a)' : string
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

