### windows

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"nominal windows t =\n    `(\n        rust_type\n            `($'std_slice_Windows<`t>')\n            `($'std::slice::Windows<`t>')\n            \"type std_slice_Windows<'T> = class end\"\n    )\n\ninl windows (len : convert.unativeint) (source : am'.vec u8) : windows u8 =\n    inl source = source |> rust.new_box |> rust.box_leak\n    inl result = !\\\\(len, $'\"<[_]>::windows(!source, $0)\"')\n    result","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  nominal windows t =
      `(
          rust_type
              `($'std_slice_Windows<`t>')
              `($'std::slice::Windows<`t>')
              "type std_slice_Windows<'T> = class end"
      )

  inl windows (len : convert.unativeint) (source : am'.vec u8) : windows u8 =
      inl source = source |> rust.new_box |> rust.box_leak
